{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675890",
      "title": "Preparing the Code for Form Submissions",
      "lectureOrder": 62,
      "videoOrder": 56,
      "sourceHash": "3a752e40c57cde0f5c7f638f224e49f7443882a07887b1b25740a82c0bb04cf9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "So let's make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 6.39,
          "en": "that we can submit this expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.39,
          "end": 7.65,
          "en": "And for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.65,
          "end": 9.21,
          "en": "I'll go to my routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.21,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "Because you add actions and loaders to your routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 14.43,
          "en": "not to your regular components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.43,
          "end": 15.33,
          "en": "That's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 17.19,
          "en": "You add them to your route components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 17.19,
          "end": 19.77,
          "en": "or to your route files instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.77,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "And I will add an action for this expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "But again, I can't add it in this expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "component file because that's a regular component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 30.45,
          "en": "But this expense form, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.45,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "gets used in some routes to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 37.97,
          "en": "It gets used in the add.jsx and $id.jsx files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "Now we'll take care about this $id.jsx file later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 47.16,
          "en": "because here we actually will be updating expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "instead of creating them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.63,
          "end": 51.21,
          "en": "And I wanna start with expense creation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.21,
          "end": 53.433,
          "en": "before we move on to updating later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.3,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "So add.jsx it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 61.25,
          "en": "And in there, I now wanna add some code that does talk",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "to my MongoDB database on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "and store my expense in that database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "with help of Prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "and with help of the data that's submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 72.003,
          "en": "through that expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "So here in add.jsx, as you already learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 79.11,
          "en": "in the Remix essentials section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.11,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "we can add a new function called action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "And this must be called action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 88.65,
          "en": "because Remix will be looking for such a action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.65,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "To be precise, Remix wants to execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "an action function in that route file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "whenever a non-GET request reaches this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 101.253,
          "en": "So the slash expenses slash add route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 104.75999999999999,
          "en": "Now in order for Remix to really be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.75999999999999,
          "end": 106.56,
          "en": "find this actual function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.56,
          "end": 108.39,
          "en": "we have to export it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.39,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "just as we have to export loaders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 113.19,
          "en": "in order for Remix to find loaders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.19,
          "end": 117.3,
          "en": "And loaders, by the way, are executed upon GET requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.3,
          "end": 118.5,
          "en": "that reached the route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.5,
          "end": 122.79,
          "en": "Actions are for all other types of requests, basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.79,
          "end": 124.32,
          "en": "And therefore, now with this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.32,
          "end": 126.63,
          "en": "this action will be executed when,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.63,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "for example, a post request reaches this slash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 131.823,
          "en": "expenses slash add route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 132.99,
          "end": 135.45,
          "en": "Now if we take another look at the expense form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "there, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "we set the method to post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 140.31,
          "en": "which means the HTTP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 140.31,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "that will be generated automatically when that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 146.52,
          "en": "is submitted, will be of, type post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 146.52,
          "end": 147.87,
          "en": "It will be using that method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.87,
          "end": 150.45,
          "en": "and that's exactly what we want to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 150.45,
          "end": 152.91,
          "en": "Therefore, in our add.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 152.91,
          "end": 154.77,
          "en": "this action will be triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 157.29,
          "en": "and in there, I now want to use Prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 157.29,
          "end": 160.833,
          "en": "to store a new expense in my database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.67000000000002,
          "end": 164.43,
          "en": "Now to do that, I'll add a new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.43,
          "end": 168.09,
          "en": "next to components and routes and styles in my app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.09,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "And I'll name it Data or util, whatever you wanna name it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "But I'll name it Data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 178.62,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add a new file, which you find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 181.653,
          "en": "The database.server.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 184.35,
          "en": "Now I'll get back to that file name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 184.35,
          "end": 186.84,
          "en": "which is (inaudible), in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.84,
          "end": 189.24,
          "en": "But I wanna start with the content of that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 189.24,
          "end": 190.92,
          "en": "as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 190.92,
          "end": 194.88,
          "en": "In that file, I'm importing this Prisma client thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 194.88,
          "end": 198.36,
          "en": "which is, in the end, all the related to the Prisma library,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 198.36,
          "end": 202.68,
          "en": "and which is an object that helps us establish a connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 204.48,
          "en": "to the Prisma database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 204.48,
          "end": 206.97,
          "en": "And we need to establish such a connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 206.97,
          "end": 209.463,
          "en": "in order to then talk to that database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.57,
          "end": 213.96,
          "en": "Now the code in that file might look rather strange though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 213.96,
          "end": 216.32999999999998,
          "en": "But in the end, what this code does is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.32999999999998,
          "end": 219.3,
          "en": "it simply checks whether this Remix application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 219.3,
          "end": 221.55,
          "en": "is running in production",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 221.55,
          "end": 223.713,
          "en": "or if we're running in development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 226.2,
          "en": "And if we're running in production,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 226.2,
          "end": 228.54,
          "en": "we simply establish a connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 228.54,
          "end": 231.633,
          "en": "to the MongoDB database through the Prisma client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 232.82999999999998,
          "end": 235.47,
          "en": "If we're running in development mode, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 238.07999999999998,
          "en": "which we are all the time in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 238.07999999999998,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "Then we also do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 242.49,
          "en": "But we make sure that we don't create multiple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 242.49,
          "end": 244.323,
          "en": "database connections accidentally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 245.19,
          "end": 246.51,
          "en": "Because when we are running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 248.52,
          "en": "this Remix server in development,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 248.52,
          "end": 252.36,
          "en": "it has a feature that automatically reloads the website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 252.36,
          "end": 255.54,
          "en": "basically whenever we make a change to our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 255.54,
          "end": 257.28,
          "en": "This is a feature that exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 257.28,
          "end": 260.25,
          "en": "so that we can preview changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 260.25,
          "end": 264.54,
          "en": "more quickly than if we have to manually reload everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 267.09,
          "en": "However, this behavior is implemented in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 267.09,
          "end": 270.54,
          "en": "by restarting the server whenever we make a code change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 270.54,
          "end": 272.46,
          "en": "Therefore, if you make a lot of code changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 272.46,
          "end": 274.40999999999997,
          "en": "we restart the server quite a bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 274.40999999999997,
          "end": 276.45,
          "en": "and therefore, we would create quite a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 276.45,
          "end": 278.7,
          "en": "of database connections since a new connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 278.7,
          "end": 281.343,
          "en": "will be established whenever that server is started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 282.24,
          "end": 284.73,
          "en": "Now in production, you only start the server once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 284.73,
          "end": 286.08,
          "en": "and then it keeps on running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 286.08,
          "end": 288.03,
          "en": "and it serves your customers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 288.03,
          "end": 290.01,
          "en": "In development, we started multiple times,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 290.01,
          "end": 291.06,
          "en": "as I just explained.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 291.06,
          "end": 294.06,
          "en": "And this code simply makes sure that we reuse",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 294.06,
          "end": 295.8,
          "en": "existing database connections",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 295.8,
          "end": 298.71,
          "en": "instead of creating a lot of new connections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 298.71,
          "end": 300.42,
          "en": "That's what this code does and will,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 300.42,
          "end": 303.03,
          "en": "therefore, use this file for interacting with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 303.03,
          "end": 306.633,
          "en": "the MongoDB database in a safe way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 308.07,
          "end": 309.39,
          "en": "Now what's also interesting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 309.39,
          "end": 311.227,
          "en": "is the name of that file, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 311.227,
          "end": 313.23,
          "en": ".server.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 313.23,
          "end": 316.713,
          "en": "and this is a specific feature supported by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 317.76,
          "end": 321.12,
          "en": "You can include .server in your file name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 321.12,
          "end": 323.19,
          "en": "right before the file extension",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 323.19,
          "end": 326.34,
          "en": "to tell a Remix that the code in this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 326.34,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "should only be executed on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 329.943,
          "en": "on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 331.17,
          "end": 332.76,
          "en": "Now, I mentioned before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 332.76,
          "end": 335.01,
          "en": "in the Remix essentials section already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 335.01,
          "end": 337.74,
          "en": "that for example, the code you write in your actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 337.74,
          "end": 340.53,
          "en": "or in your loaders will only be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 340.53,
          "end": 341.43,
          "en": "on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 341.43,
          "end": 343.743,
          "en": "Remix will automatically split the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 345.09000000000003,
          "end": 347.34000000000003,
          "en": "However, in more complex applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 347.34000000000003,
          "end": 350.76,
          "en": "where you are importing code from other files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 350.76,
          "end": 353.88,
          "en": "Remix could end up in situations where it doesn't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 353.88,
          "end": 356.76,
          "en": "whether a certain import should also be included",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 356.76,
          "end": 358.08,
          "en": "in the frontend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 358.08,
          "end": 360.78,
          "en": "or only for the backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 360.78,
          "end": 364.38,
          "en": "And, therefore, if you add .server in your file name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 364.38,
          "end": 367.29,
          "en": "right before the extension, you tell Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 367.29,
          "end": 370.71,
          "en": "that whenever you are importing anything from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 370.71,
          "end": 373.95,
          "en": "So if you're importing in another file from that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 373.95,
          "end": 376.83,
          "en": "the code in this file should only be included",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 376.83,
          "end": 378.39,
          "en": "in the backend code bundle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 378.39,
          "end": 380.31,
          "en": "not in the frontend code bundle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 380.31,
          "end": 382.29,
          "en": "And this feature simply exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 382.29,
          "end": 385.32,
          "en": "so that we don't accidentally expose code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 385.32,
          "end": 387.93,
          "en": "in our frontend code that shouldn't be exposed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 387.93,
          "end": 389.25,
          "en": "And of course to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 389.25,
          "end": 391.38,
          "en": "that we're not shipping unnecessary code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 391.38,
          "end": 394.02,
          "en": "as part of our frontend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 394.02,
          "end": 395.88,
          "en": "So this .server thing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 395.88,
          "end": 399.39,
          "en": "in the file name is an extra hint we give to Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 399.39,
          "end": 401.97,
          "en": "to ensure that this code really never ends up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 401.97,
          "end": 403.92,
          "en": "on the frontend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 403.92,
          "end": 407.76,
          "en": "Normally, Remix should be able to split the code on its own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 407.76,
          "end": 410.58,
          "en": "For example, if you're using a feature in an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 410.58,
          "end": 413.22,
          "en": "it will only include the code of that feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 413.22,
          "end": 414.69,
          "en": "in the server side bundle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 414.69,
          "end": 415.92,
          "en": "But to be super safe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 415.92,
          "end": 419.043,
          "en": "you can add the .server part in the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 420,
          "end": 421.68,
          "en": "And with that, we now added the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 421.68,
          "end": 425.49,
          "en": "We need to code to really talk to the MongoDB database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 425.49,
